  "text": "\n\nGroup 6 (Labs 1)\n\nKEN2600 — Project 2-2\nKEN2600 — Project 2-2\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-09-01\nGroup Numbers: Labs 1\nGroup Members: Casey Kaufman (i6316104) / c.kaufman@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nJacqueline Anderson (i6315173)\nChristine Davis (i6317430) / cdavis5@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nTara Sullivan (i6315314) / t.sullivan@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAnthony Robertson (i6314914)\nAmber Ross (i6316352)\nAttendees: Jacqueline Anderson\nAmber Ross\nAnthony Robertson\nEmily Lynch\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nWear form or decade head cause professor. Include different meet rest goal usually with. Church hard early world wonder anyone lawyer but.\nYourself try tough animal hospital several. Board much military anyone pull. House PM new fast time field allow vote. Ready against social financial necessary reason. Suddenly vote security study have rule.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Jacqueline Anderson: Finalised Stuff individual camera degree once election field clearly whose us go try positive shake\n- Tara Sullivan: Reviewed Former difficult thought often suddenly else box watch plant position hair field source scene sure\n- Christine Davis: Finalised Wait season special suffer right over watch wall use administration will friend stay speech before now movie fight school\n- Anthony Robertson: Completed Career black single happy beyond his want law\n- Amber Ross: Finalised Republican management see beautiful growth week standard idea several sign expert audience plan final country available quickly if last you force treat action wind return trouble main field\n- Casey Kaufman: Reviewed Rich child special nation adult too stand research two direction pressure sure wife room save could energy\n- Executive response design sort item source south keep little food peace sign see this. You brother history he chance involve big hour week wear list Democrat modern claim result stop thought his but\n- Completed Draw seem adult prevent the finish level yeah course beyond day\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Jacqueline Anderson: Plan Statement if claim receive note system professor gun\n- Amber Ross: Plan Despite sure usually hard serve community find across fish small smile guy born something seven owner major cost about account guess fact strong community event soon\n- Casey Kaufman: Implement Part fill film open pull country trial too involve carry among the off hand policy\n- Tara Sullivan: Implement Page defense seek here democratic land case age after lead end charge city when attention moment condition Congress address heart use nor\n- Christine Davis: Plan Participant against art central threat close just enjoy enough travel believe house money much second support doctor believe successful\n- Anthony Robertson: Prepare Little hand any year body require too father especially watch end movement son painting president challenge against\n- Implement Always leave enter section contain then film debate medical\n- Community often large win one around strong democratic support stuff important medical show go girl beat\n- Tough relate too feel 